BeyondDB Cellar runtime adapter

The bounded wire codec, logical identity helpers, pure application/module
descriptors and SQL value wire codecs are adapted from
https://github.com/crabbuild/cellule at
1d0648b3b5ae0cca040c614b505b4d72bb769ab1, licensed under Apache-2.0.
These helpers contain no Cellule execution, ownership, storage or peer runtime.
